# mod-custom-spells: player reports of 2026-10-29 on the warlock's extra demons.
# (1) 900835 lesser demons came from a bare summon: level 80 whatever the
#     warlock's level, drawn hostile by the client; now the warlock's guardian
#     (SummonProperties 61), so it takes the warlock's level.
# (2) 900858's second demon kept the level it was made at; now it follows the
#     warlock's demon (a new copy at the new level).
# The warlock is set to level 70 (and back to 80 in the cleanup) to make both visible;
# the second demon is sent at the dummy with .cspet attack. Test ground: map 13, the FL dummy
# arena (AoE Training Dummies 920018). Spells: Summon Imp 688 (416), Summon
# Voidwalker 697 (1860); lesser demons 900835-900837.
name    Custom spells - report warlock demons
timeout 180s

bot wl warlock slot=5

place 13 -279 150 -423.2 0
require wl alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near wl
require d1 exists
do gm target wl
as gm .levelup -10
as gm .unlearn 900835
as gm .unlearn 900858
do wl learn 688
do wl learn 697

log 900858 - the Voidwalker stays as the second demon at the warlock's level 70
do wl learn 900858
do wl cast 697 triggered
waitfor wl minions 1860 == 1 timeout 5s
do wl cast 688 triggered
waitfor wl minions 416 == 1 timeout 5s
wait 1500ms
pick sv creature:1860 near wl
require sv exists
waitfor sv aura 900526 timeout 3s
do gm target sv
as gm .npc info
expect output value Level == 70

log 900858 - one level up: the second demon follows to 71
do gm target wl
as gm .levelup 1
wait 3s
pick sv2 creature:1860 near wl
require sv2 exists
do gm target sv2
as gm .npc info
expect output value Level == 71

log 900835 - the second demon's (Voidwalker) hits summon a Lesser Voidwalker (900837) at the warlock's level (71), not 80
do wl learn 900835
do wl approach d1
do wl target d1
as wl .cspet attack
do wl attack d1
waitfor wl minions 900837 >= 1 timeout 90s
pick ls creature:900837 near wl
require ls exists
do gm target ls
as gm .npc info
expect output value Level == 71
expect output value Faction != 14
expect wl cannotattack ls

cleanup
do wl stop
do gm target wl
as gm .unlearn 900835
as gm .unlearn 900858
as gm .levelup 9
